            "dct:description": {
                "@language": "eng",
                "@value": "This dataset contains information on company addresses relating to business permits. These are required for commercial and craft activities, as well as certain liberal professions, when carried out by self-employed individuals or companies, in Luxembourg. Once the business permit has been cancelled, the addresses are not updated anymore.\nPlease note that most of the variables in this dataset are \"This dataset contains information on company addresses relating to business permits. These are required for commercial and craft activities, as well as certain liberal professions, when carried out by self-employed individuals or companies, in Luxembourg. Once the business permit has been cancelled, the addresses are not updated anymore. Please note that most of the variables in this dataset are public."
            },
